<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Teck Guan debuts at 8.00 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Teck Guan debuts at 8.00 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Teck Guan Perdana Bhd made their market debut at 8.00 ringgit against an offer price of 2.30.</p>
<p>The investment holding company which is involved in cocoa operations made a public issue of three million shares for its listing on the second board Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>Around 25 minutes into the opening, the stock was at 8.35 ringit on volume of 735,000 shares traded.</p>
<p>The company forecast gross earnings per share of 38.10 cents for the year ending January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>At 8.00 ringgit, gross price-to-earnings ratio is 21 times.</p>
</text>
